"Trouble shooting": "Go to the Service menu\t, line S05 Configuration. Verify that the container ID on line F01 is correct.\nGo to the Service menu , line S09 Modem. Verify if the gateway serial number on line W01 is correct. Take a photo.\nGo to the Information menu . Verify if the battery voltage on line I31 is 12 V or more. Take a photo.\nTurn the reefer unit off and disconnect the AC power cable.\nDisconnect the battery from the gateway.\nDisconnect the battery from the controller X3.\nDisconnect the gateway from the controller X9.\nCheck that the gateway and battery are mounted correctly to the AC power. Take a photo.\nReconnect the gateway to the controller X9. Take a photo.\nReconnect the battery to the controller X3. Take a photo.\nEnsuring the connectors are rotated correctly, connect the battery to the gateway. Take a photo.\nConnect AC power and turn the reefer unit on.\nAfter 30 minutes on AC power, note the gateway LED status.\nCheck again if the gateway serial number is shown in the Modem menu. Take a photo.\nIf the LED is not solid green or no data is uploaded after 1 hour, contact sekstant-support@mcicontainers.com.",
